  "solution": "Given:​\n\n[(5)/(8)-left{(5)/(8)-((5)/(8)-(3)/(8))right}] of 3.6 - 0.8 ÷ 10\n\nConcept used:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/c7a9b9173e89d44a854cc9c8053cf1e4425472078909d5687a2dfa61a2ec670c.png] \n\nCalculation:\n\n[(5)/(8)-left{(5)/(8)-((5)/(8)-(3)/(8))right}] of 3.6 - 0.8 ÷ 10\n\n⇒ [ {5 over 8} - { ({5 over 8} - {1 over 4})} ] of 3.6 - 0.08\n\n⇒ [ {5 over 8} - {3 over 8} ] of 3.6 - 0.08\n\n⇒ 0.25 of 3.6 - 0.08\n\n⇒ 0.9 - 0.08\n\n⇒ 0.82\n\n**∴ The required value is 0.82.**",
